  "source_format": "YouTube format 251 -- Opus, 48 kHz stereo, ~130 kb/s. The plain rung, NOT 251-drc, which is dynamic-range compressed and forbidden by the audio standard. Decoded once to pcm_s24le at its native 48 kHz; no resample anywhere in the chain.",
